==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*þwahaną}}. Cognate with {{etyl|osx|-}} {{m|osx|thwahan}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{m|goh|dwahan}}, {{etyl|non|-}} {{m|non|þvá}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐌸𐍅𐌰𐌷𐌰𐌽}}. The Germanic base is also the source of {{etyl|en|-}} {{m|en|towel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/θwæːan/|lang=ang}}

===Verb===
{{ang-verb|head=þwēan}}

# to [[wash]], [[anoint]]

